{"4435760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hellbridge", "steam_appid": 4435760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5054960], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR WISHES HAVE CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every wishlist has become fuels for the Final Wave. Try it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/de12a3b32ce7559394ad54e670f67461.poster.avif?t=1788022923\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/de12a3b32ce7559394ad54e670f67461.webm?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/de12a3b32ce7559394ad54e670f67461.mp4?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOLD THE LAST BRIDGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One bridge. Two worlds. Endless hell. </i><br>The invasion is here. The living world’s last stand is a single stone bridge. <br>Hold it against endless waves, or watch everything fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR POWER EACH RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spells through evolving drafts.<br>Shape your build around destruction, control, or survival.<br>Synergize abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your faithful spirit companion—your only friend in the slaughter. <br>Adapt to shifting enemy scenarios.<br>No two sieges play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/107933bbb4c06afdaa28717839b4baa3.avif?t=1788022923\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras_big/107933bbb4c06afdaa28717839b4baa3.avif?t=1788022923 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND. ENTER. DESTROY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the pressure reaches its peak, the cursed Gates open.<br>Enter them to strike at the source of the invasion —<br>and come face to face with the one who guards it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your decisions shape the course of the siege: close the Gates to change the directions of enemy attacks — and even influence what the final battle will become.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/94f8c2cfd999ea32b22e624e8c6366bf.poster.avif?t=1788022923\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/94f8c2cfd999ea32b22e624e8c6366bf.webm?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/94f8c2cfd999ea32b22e624e8c6366bf.mp4?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW STRONGER OVER TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades.<br>Refine your strategy.<br>Push deeper into the siege.<br>Every run makes you deadlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST. CLEAN. DEADLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive movement.<br>Tight combat.<br>Endless pressure.<br>Hold the bridge — or watch the world fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/d4114622ca6a730d0b30239e2072f435.avif?t=1788022923\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras_big/d4114622ca6a730d0b30239e2072f435.webp?t=1788022923 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR WISHES HAVE CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every wishlist has become fuels for the Final Wave. Try it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/de12a3b32ce7559394ad54e670f67461.poster.avif?t=1788022923\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/de12a3b32ce7559394ad54e670f67461.webm?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/de12a3b32ce7559394ad54e670f67461.mp4?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOLD THE LAST BRIDGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One bridge. Two worlds. Endless hell. </i><br>The invasion is here. The living world’s last stand is a single stone bridge. <br>Hold it against endless waves, or watch everything fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR POWER EACH RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spells through evolving drafts.<br>Shape your build around destruction, control, or survival.<br>Synergize abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your faithful spirit companion—your only friend in the slaughter. <br>Adapt to shifting enemy scenarios.<br>No two sieges play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/107933bbb4c06afdaa28717839b4baa3.avif?t=1788022923\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras_big/107933bbb4c06afdaa28717839b4baa3.avif?t=1788022923 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND. ENTER. DESTROY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the pressure reaches its peak, the cursed Gates open.<br>Enter them to strike at the source of the invasion —<br>and come face to face with the one who guards it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your decisions shape the course of the siege: close the Gates to change the directions of enemy attacks — and even influence what the final battle will become.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/94f8c2cfd999ea32b22e624e8c6366bf.poster.avif?t=1788022923\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/94f8c2cfd999ea32b22e624e8c6366bf.webm?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/94f8c2cfd999ea32b22e624e8c6366bf.mp4?t=1788022923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW STRONGER OVER TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades.<br>Refine your strategy.<br>Push deeper into the siege.<br>Every run makes you deadlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST. CLEAN. DEADLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive movement.<br>Tight combat.<br>Endless pressure.<br>Hold the bridge — or watch the world fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras/d4114622ca6a730d0b30239e2072f435.avif?t=1788022923\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435760/extras_big/d4114622ca6a730d0b30239e2072f435.webp?t=1788022923 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_descr